<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Utasorhonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur Uburhu uwu inggbaashia aka atsɛnge abi Utasorhonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Utasorhonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Uta</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur Uburhu uwu inggbaashia aka atsɛnge abi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Utasorhonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Utasorhonika uwu inggbaashia</para>
  <para style="ip">Uburhu uner itser Uyesu atsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ ra abika adɔsa ru Utasorhonika ra abĩ Umakidoniya. Abɔɔ agɛ Uburhu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ru Ukorinti ra amɛk aki 50-51 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Abika adɔsa ru Utasorhonika awu unying ra abika adɔsa ha Uburhu uner itser Uyesu aka adzin. Unga aka adzin umbɔ asi ikpoa inɛta umbɔ, ubinkutsu abi Uyahuda abee ifuw nggu unga na atsu unga abɔre umɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Aiy 17.1-9</ref></char>). Uburhu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ afituwe abika adɔsa ugɛ umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri imangmangmbɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ri inggbaashia, Uburhu atar uwɛɛ ru Unum ri itsi imangmangmbɔ nu ikikorhambɔ iyi ibibema nu ikɛi ifosayɛ umbɔ aka awerangge ru Ukiristo. Ubvur ha ufituwe abika adɔsa ugɛ umbɔ niba agbambɔ iwei ri itsi ibiba Ukiristo. Ikɛi udɛyiwe umbɔ ikpũ isiseiyɛ iki imɛ̃ umbɔ asei, na amina asumbɔ atɔ̃ itsermbɔ utsɛku Uyesu aka iba.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 1:1-3">1.1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imangmang abi Utasorhonika <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 1:4-3:13">1.4—3.13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ikpũ ibibɛkyɛ Unum aka abee <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4.1-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imesa ri itsi ibiba Uteijee <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4.13—5.11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itsũwã iyi imaatak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5.12-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5.23-28</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Ubvur uwurɛ udzeku umum Uburhu. Usirha nu Utimoti awu urhɔnga nggu umum umɛn ighwe umbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ubvur uzĩ ri ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Utasarhonika umbɔ aka awu abi Unum Utɛ nu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Imimuta nu ididɔɔr ru umbi.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itar uwɛɛ abi Utasorhonika ri imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Umɛn iki isaki itar uwɛɛ indzowe Unum ru umbi kishoo, iyisa atsokmbi ri ifɛn-Nummɛn. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ iyita ra asu Unum Utɛmɛn itsermbi iyi imangmang, nu ikikorhambi iyi ibibema, nu ibibimambi iyi ifosa ru Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo.<verse eid="1TH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn ihwɛngmɛn awu Unum abema umbi na asɛng umbi, <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>ubinkutsu, Isarhe Iyiki Izemɛn iba ru umbi isi iwengge ri irhɛm ukpekũ, bɔr iwe nggu ijee, nu Ipfu Isarsatangge nu ida icicang. Umbi ahwɛngmbi isiseimɛn iyi inggbaashia ru umbi umɛn iyika umbi. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Umbi aka awu abika amesa umɛn nu Uteijee, ubinkutsu umbi ayɛi arherha ha ru nggaa ayetnum nggu anggɔmkɛ Ipfu Isarsatangge iki idzaa. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Ngge itsu umbi awe abin aka amesa ra abika adɔsa kishoo ra abĩ Umakidoniya nu Uakaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Asi iwea Umakidoniya nu Uakaya ukpekũ isarhe Uteijee iki idzeku umbi izĩ, bɔr imangmangmbi ru Unum aka ahwɛngmbɔ ubɛn anang. Nggee umɛn ishimɛn nu ubinkpi umɛn iki irherhe ra ake, <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>ubinkutsu anera nibikambɔ aki isɔm ikpũ amɛnkɛ umbi aka akũ ayɛi umɛn. Umbɔ asɔm ugɛ umbi aka aneke idɔsa agberhe, na adzipa atɔ̃we itser ru Unum uwu idzidzɛrhe uwu urhɛ, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>na adzɛu Ungwɛ̃nga aka idzeka afã, uwuruwi unga aka azituwe ra akpe, Uyesu uwuku ushɔɔrte umɛn ru uvɔmwi uku iba.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Itser Uburhu ru Utasorhonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ iyiyepamɛn iki ĩba ru umbi isi igbangge abĩ. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Umɛn iki ihwamɛn ayetnum nu urhena ru Ufirhipi, ru nyaka umbi aka ahwɛng, bɔr iyiyike Unummɛn itsu umɛn ĩdzaa umbi Isarhe Iyiki Izenga ra asu uver ukerketakpɔ ukpu ikpikpɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Ivangyɛ umɛn itsu umbi awe ru imangmang umɛn isi igbamɛn irhak use ida isisar use umɛn ibee ibvuta umbi. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Bɔr umɛn iwu abirabɛ Unum aka anyã umɛn imɛ̃ɛ̃mɛn idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize. Umɛn isi ĩbeemɛn irherhe abinkɛ anera aka abee bɔr abinkɛ Unum uwuku uvira amɛnmɛn aka abee. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Umbi ahwɛngmbi arherhamɛn asi iweke itonga angwĩ, use umɛn ikũ ubin ukpɔɔ itsire atsimɛn ri ibee uhwɛk, Unum unga awu idekamɛn. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Umɛn isi ĩbeemɛn anera akpoi umɛn, use umbi use abikase.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Umɛn iwu abi itser Uyesu umɛn iwemɛn ri ijee iyiki ibee ubin ru umbi, <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>bɔr umɛn iwu ru nyaka awɛkaci ru umbi, ru nyaku uyi aki ikpɔm angwɛ̃nga. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Umɛn ibema umbi akarhãrhã, ngge itsu umɛn isi ĩdzaamɛn umbi Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Unum ukpekũ, bɔr umɛn igũibɛn idzowe urhɛmɛn, ubinkutsu umbi awe azeze ru umɛn. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, idzidzɛrhe umbi ayitumbi ititɛ̃wãmɛn nu ayetnummɛn, umɛn itɔ̃ itser utsuu nu atenum isi igũmɛn azhe utsur umɛn iyɔmmɛn unera ru umbi ivangyɛ umɛn iki idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ru umbi.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Umbi nggu Unum awu ideka, ra amɛn aka asar, nu irhirhika nu ida uvau umɛn iki iwe ru umbi abika adɔsa ri inggbaashia. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi umɛn iwe nggu umbi ru nyaka atei aki iwe nggu awɛkacimbɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Umɛn ifituwa ni iyika umbi ni itsu umbi asei ra amɛnkɛ Unum aka abee, unga aka ayisa umbi ri Iyɛrhanga nu ikpikpoi.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Umɛn isi inekukumɛn itar uwɛɛ ru Unum ra akɛrɛ ha, ubinkutsu, ivangyɛ umbi aka ayɛi Arherhu-Num umbi aka agũ ru umɛn, umbi abema ake asi iweke ru nyaka arherhe anera, bɔr ru nyaka ake aka awe. Awe Arherhu-Num aka atɔ̃ itser ru umbi aka awe ru imangmang. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umbi awe abika amesu kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsu Unum ru Uyahudiya, umbɔ aka awe ru Ukiristo Uyesu. Umbi ahwa ayetnum ra anermbi ubina unying nggu abika adɔsa ha aka ahwa ra abok abi Uyahuda, <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>abika afɛre Uteijee Uyesu nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num ikɛi na awayiwe umɛn idzek. Umbɔ adakuwe amɛn Unum na akpɛ̃mbɔ ubɛn unera <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>ri ititɛ̃wãmbɔ umbɔ akɛnmbɔ umɛn idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra atsen abi Uyahuda utsur umbɔ akpombɔ ififɔrh. Rimi hã ubɛn unum umbɔ aki itomu ugbiu arhimmbɔ akarhãrhã. Avɔm Unum aka acipuwake nu atsimbɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu abee ibvui ayepa <optbreak/> abi Utasorhonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Bɔr umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ivangyɛ umɛn iki idzipa ineke umbi ri ivanga ukunjiir, igigau ha iwu iyi iyor isi iwengge iyi amɛn, ngge itsu umɛn itsu asumɛn itɛ̃wã ibee ĩba inyã umbi. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Ubinkutsu umɛn ibee ĩba ru umbi, udzumunga awu umum Uburhu iki ibee ikɛi nu ikɛi, bɔr Ushaitan akɛna umɛn. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Asi iwea umbi awu ifosamɛn, nu igũibɛnmɛn nu ifur iyɛrheyɛ umɛn iki ikũ ifĩrhã ra asu Uteijee Uyesu unga aba abanga? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Idzidzɛrhe umbi awu ikpikpoimɛn nu igũibɛn.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Nggee ivangyɛ umɛn iki ifɔr ibibima idamɛn, umɛn inyã izengge umbɔ aneka umɛn ukpekũ ru Uatina. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Umɛn ĩdene Utimoti, aka awu ungwɛ̃mɛn nu uwɛrhu itser Unum ri idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Ukiristo, unga adzaa umbi ikeramɛn na afituwa umbi ri imangmangmbi, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>ngge itsú unera asi ítsũwũka amɛnnga ri ivivira iyɛrɛ. Ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ asɛng umɛn ikorha akɛrɛ ha. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Idzidzɛrhe, ivangyɛ umɛn iki iwu nggu umbi, ubɛn unuma umɛn isɔma umbi ugɛ umɛn iwuri ihwa uver. Ngge iwe rimi hã, ru nyaka umbi aka ahwɛng. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Ngge itsu, ivangyɛ umum iki isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ imɛ̃ɛ̃mum, umum ĩdene unga aba nu umum ima igũ isarhe imangmangmbi. Umum igũ iwei ugɛ use uwuku uvuviri ha aka avirunga umbi, ikɛi ayetnummɛn hã aka awe ibɛm.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔm ififitu Utimoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Bɔr icɛrɛ Utimoti anai idzeku umbi aba ru umɛn, akũwã umɛn isarhe iyi imangmang nu ibibemambi. Unga asɔma umɛn ugɛ ubɛn unuma umbi anu iyita umɛn nggu iki ize na abee inyã umɛn, ru nyaka umɛn iki ibee inya umbi. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Nggee, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ri kishoo igũ ighong nu uvermɛn, umɛn ikpomɛn ififita ri itsi imangmangmbi. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Ubinkutsu, icɛrɛ umɛn iwemɛn ri ikeramɛn ikɛi, umbi aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ akermbi akarhãrhã ru Uteijee. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Umɛn itarmɛn uwɛɛ ru Unum akarhãrhã ru umbi, ri igũibɛnyɛ umɛn iki iwurangge ra atsimbi ra asu Unummɛn. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Nu utsuu nu atenum umɛn ifɛn-Num akarhãrhã ugɛ umɛn ima inyã umbi ikɛi ni ĩdzaa ubinkpi umbi aka ashimbi rakpɔ ri imangmangmbi.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Unum Utɛmɛn itsikamnga nu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu ama ayanguwa utsĩndĩ uwuku uba ru umbi. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Uteijee ha ama atomuwa ibibemambi ngge itɔk ni ibɔr igba ra adɔka nu ubɛn unera, ru nyaka umɛn iki ikorhuwa umbi. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Unga ama atsu umbi awe ru ikeramɛn, ngge itsú umbi awe abika asheru uvau na awu asasar ra asu Unum Utɛmɛn, ivangyɛ Uteijeemɛn Uyesu aka iba nggu kishoo asarkasarnga.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Isei isei iyiriyɛ Unum aka abema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Ri imimasha, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn imesuwa umbi isei isei iyi ibibemu Unum, ru nyaka umbi aka asei. Icɛrɛ umɛn irhusa ni itsu umbi ri itsok Uteijee Uyesu àka atoma asei rimi hã. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi ubinkpi umɛn iki itsuka umbi ri ijee iyi Uteijee Uyesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Awu ibibemu Unum umbi asei asasar, na niba akorhumbi kishoo itser itoma-dak. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Ubɛn unera ru umbi amesi ikpɔm iyornga ru utsĩndĩ isisar nu imor, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>isi iwengge iyi ikponi iyor iyiriyɛ atsen abi Uyahuda aka asi ihwɛngmbɔ Unum. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Ikɛi ra arherhe itoma-dak ha unera niba agbaa avau ru ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unga akpo utsĩndĩ adakuwe amɛn ungwɛ̃mbɔ. Uteijee awuri itsuka ufai ra anera ru ikpũ arhim akɛrɛ kishoo, ru nyaka umɛn iki isɔma umbi ni igbiita atombi. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Ubinkutsu, Unum asi iyisunga umɛn isisei iyiki ida isisar, bɔr umɛn ibɛk ri isisar. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Nggee, unga uwuku ukpɛ̃ imesa iyɛrɛ asi ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ unera, bɔr akpɛ̃ Unum, uwuku udzisa umbi Ipfunga Isarsatangge.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Umɛn isi íbvui itsɛngamɛn umbi arherhe ibema angwɛ̃mbi, umbi nibikambi Unum aka amesuwanga umbi ibema adɔka. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Idzidzɛrhe, umbi aka isaka abemumbi abika adɔsa kishoo ra abĩ Umakidoniya. Rimi hã umɛn ifituwa umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka atoma akorhe rimi hã ikɛi.<verse eid="1TH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Àka anyanga ngge iwu ubinkpi umbi aka abee, ri isei isei uku ughwɔɔw ri ibibɛkmbi, aka atsu amɛn ri itsermbi ukpekũ na akũ abokmbi atɔ̃ itser, ru nyaka umɛn iki isɔma umbi. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Mɔcɛ inum ibibɛkmbi iwuri ikũ abirabɛ aka asi ihwɛngmbɔ Unum adzaa umbi imor, ngge itsú umbi aneke itsorha atsimbi ra ayor anera.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibiba Uteijee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn isi ibeemɛn umbi awe abika ada ihwɛng ubin ri itsi abɔrɔ aka awu ru urhɔ akpe, use umbi agũ ighong ru nyaka aner abɔɔ, abika ashimbɔ ri ifosa. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Umɛn iwemɛn ri imangmang ugɛ Uyesu akpe na asoka ikɛi, nggee umɛn iwemɛn ri imangmang ugɛ Unum awuri ikũ abika adɔsa ha aka akpe aba nggu Uyesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Ru nyaka Arherhu Uteijee, umɛn idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ umɛn iki ibɛk icɛrɛ, umɛn ibɛk utsɛku ibiba Uteijee, umɛn isi ínggbaashia isomɛn ra abirabɛ aka awu ru urhɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Ubinkutsu Uteijee nibikanga awuri idzeka afã acipuwa, nggu uyisa ijee utsotsorakpɔ, nggu urhɛm unggbaashi ípfu itser-Num nu irhak utsom ukpu Unum, abika akpe ru Ukiristo awuri igbaashia asok. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Aki ha aba amaake, umɛn abi urhɛ awuri ishupa umɛn nggu umbɔ ra amɛɛ ru umɛn ikpo Uteijee ra afafã. Nu umɛn iwuri iwe nggu Uteijee ugbagbaa. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Nggee àka afituwe adɔka nggu irhɛm iyɛrɛ ha.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ri itsi ivang nu inum, umɛn isi ibeemɛn itsɛnga umbi, <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi uku ushashaki ugɛ unum ukpu Uteijee uwuri iba ru nyaku uvɛu ru untsuuka. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Ivangyɛ anera aka ani igɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn isei isei uku ughwɔɔw nu ififɔrh,&gt;&gt; kanying itsitsim iwuri ikpo umbɔ, ru nyaki ihwashi imar iki ikpo ukutsɛrh uwuku uwu ra anaa, utsĩndĩ ishishɔɔr ushimgbɔ ru umbɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Bɔr umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umbi asi iwembi ru uzĩ, ngge itsú unum hã usi ígbipukpɔ umbi ru nyaku uvɛu. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Umbi kishoo awe angwɛ̃ irhirhang na angwɛ̃ atenum. Umɛn isi iwemɛn abi utsuu use abi uzĩ. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Nggee, umɛn niba iwemɛn ru nyaka abɔɔ aka awe ru urhɔ, bɔr umɛn isei ĩdzɛu ni ikpɔm atsimɛn. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Ubinkutsu abika arharhɔ arha ru untsuu nu abika afĩrhã adɛ afĩrhã ru untsuu. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Bɔr umɛn iki iwe abi atenum, awu ufang umɛn ingwɛ̃dzɛn ni ikpɔm atsimɛn, itsim imangmang nu ibibema ru nyaka atorho uzɔu aki ikɔk, ni ifosi ififɔrh ru nyaki ifur uzɔu. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Ubinkutsu, Unum asi itsũã umɛn ihwa ayetnum avɔmnga, bɔr atsũ umɛn ikpo ififɔrh ru ubok Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Unga akpe ri itsimɛn, ngge itsú uko umɛn iwu aka arhi use umɛn iwu ru urhɔ, umɛn ima isei urhɔnga nggu unga. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Nggee àka afita adɔka na adzin adɔka, ru nyaka umbi aki ikorhe.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimashi imesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn ishɔ̃rhã umbi, àka adzowe imor ra abika atɛ̃wũ itser ru umbi, anggbaashimbi ru Uteijee, abika adzaa umbi itsũwã. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Àka akpɔm umbɔ afafã ri ibibema ri itsi itsermbɔ. Àka asei uku ughwɔɔw nggu adɔka. <verse eid="1TH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn ishɔ̃rhã umbi, àka agbiite ato abi ighɛrha ru umbi, àka afituwe abika asheri ikeramɛn ru umbi, àka ayike abika asheri iker ru umbi, àka adɔng amɛnmbi nggu ubɛn unera. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn, utsur unera afasa iyiki ibewe nggu iyiki ibewe, bɔr ubɛn ivang àka akorhi iyiki ize nggu adɔka nu ubɛn unera.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Àka agɔm anggɔm ubɛn ivang, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>àka niba anekukumbi ifɛn-Num, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>àka atar uwɛɛ ri kishoo ubinkpi uku uwe, ubinkutsu ngge iwu ibibemu Unum ru umbi ru Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Àka niba arhĩwukumbi Ipfu-Num. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Àka niba akwɛɛrkumbi itser iyiki isɔm Arherhu-Num, <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>àka avira abina kishoo, na akpɔm akirakɛ aka awe aka aze, <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>àka atĩmbi ubɛn iyiki ibewe.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Unum nibikanga, Unum uwu ididɔɔr, ama asare umbi undzumunga, ipfumbi nu urhɛmbi nu ayormbi kishoo ima isheru uvau ru unumkpi Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo aka iba. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Unga awuri ikorhunga ake, ubinkutsu unga uwuku uyisa umbi awu uner idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn àka afɛna-Num ru umɛn. <verse eid="1TH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Àka aghwe adɔka nggu ighwe ibibema. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi ri itsok Uteijee, àka avarhuwe ubvur uwurɛ ra angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn kishoo.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Imimuta Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo ima iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
